### 查询订单可用征集动作
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/solicitations/actions/get
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","amazonOrderId":"123-1234567-1234567"}

### 发起商品评论与卖家反馈征集
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/solicitations/product-review-and-seller-feedback/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","amazonOrderId":"123-1234567-1234567"}
